@startuml
title Activity Diagram - Search & Query Insights
top to bottom direction

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontSize 14
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFF8C6
  BorderColor Black
  FontSize 12
}

note top
Steps:
1) Enter query + filters
2) Build SearchQuery + embeddings (internal)
3) Search index (semantic + metadata)
4) Rank + show SearchHits
5) If user opens a hit, display snippet + asset link
6) Refine query or save results
end note

(*) --> "1. Enter query\n+ filters"
--> "2. Build SearchQuery\n+ embeddings"
--> "3. Search index\n(semantic + metadata)"
--> "4. Rank + show\nSearchHits"

if (Open a hit?) then (Yes)
  --> "5. Display snippet\n+ asset link"
else
  --> "6. Refine query\nor save results"
endif

--> "6. Refine query\nor save results"
--> (*)

@enduml